#extension flag - network port forward to vm.
# syntax: -port-fwd <{tcp|udp}:[hostaddr]:[hostport]-[vmaddr]:guestport>
# examples:
# -port-fwd tcp::1234-:1234 (default host and vm address)
# -port-fwd udp::-:1234 (random host port)
# vm ip must be 10.0.2.15 (see https://www.qemu.org/docs/master/system/devices/net.html)
#
-device virtio-net-pci,netdev=net0
-netdev user,id=net0,hostfwd=%s